      "guid": "com.hazelify.sptmodsinstaller",
      "name": "SPT Mods Installer",
      "slug": "spt-mods-installer",
      "teaser": "A simple little application that allows drag-and-dropping mods in zip formats.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1742.png",
      "downloads": 41483,
      "favourites_count": 30,
      "description": "<h3>Simple installation guide:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Download the app from the blue button next to the title.</li>\n<li>Extract <strong>SPT Mods Installer.exe</strong> to any existing SPT folder (same place as <strong>EscapeFromTarkov.exe</strong>).</li>\n<li>Run <strong>SPT Mods Installer.exe</strong>.</li>\n<li>Drag and drop any compressed archives into the application (supported extensions: .rar, .zip, .7z).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Caveat</h3>\n<p>This tool has no safeguards against how many mods you run through it. If it freezes while installing a mod, <em>it is working as intended</em>. Please be patient.</p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/dimensions_1083636?term=layer&amp;page=1&amp;position=20&amp;origin=search&amp;related_id=1083636\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">flaticon.com</a> for their amazing collection of logos</p>\n<p>As usual, always available on Discord:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>net.hazelify or the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Xn9msqQZan\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Discord server</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n",
